Architecture: follows the established P4 seam convention (ref CostSummaryCards.* / the 250 sibling surfaces): the SwiftUI
              view binds an @Observable VehicleCostModel through the VehicleCostSource seam; the live binding to the KMP
              OperatorConfidenceStore.vehicleCost feed is finalized in AppContainer (ADR-004) — the same deferral every
              shared-core-backed surface uses (no feature-view imports Shared directly; AppContainer.bootstrap is the one
              KMP-constructor site). Previews + tests drive the seam with InMemoryVehicleCostSource. SI/raw on the wire;
              numbers formatted only at the display boundary (web lib/numberFormat + lib/dateFormat reproduced exactly).
              This page is a polled REST read (web useVehicleCost, SLOW poll) — NOT an SSE-live source — so, faithfully to
              the web, it carries no >2-min staleness chip (ADR-013 applies only to live sources).

