SURFACE PARITY — what was ported from the web source (no scope narrowing)
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
• Header        : PageContainer title + subtitle → VehicleCostHeader (TSPageTitle + muted subtitle), nav title set.
• Subsystem 503 : web `error.status === 503` AlertBanner(variant=warning, notConfigured) → VehicleCostSubsystemBanner
                  (TSAlertBanner tone .warning), shown above the report; model maps .api(503,SUBSYSTEM_NOT_CONFIGURED)
                  → .subsystemUnavailable (documented live mapping; InMemory drives it in previews/tests).
• Fleet totals  : web FleetTotalsCards (4× StatCard label/value/sublabel) → VehicleCostTotalsSection + VehicleCostTotalTile,
                  projected by VehicleCostProjection.totalsCards in the exact order/labels/values/sublabels; zero-fallback
                  cards so the four panels always render (loading → TSStatGridSkeleton).
• Per-vehicle   : web GlassPanel + window Select + sortable DataTable (6 cols) → VehicleCostBreakdownPanel (TSGlassPanel) +
                  TSSelect window picker (1/7/30/90 d, default 30) + VehicleCostTable (TSDataTable, 6 TSColumns, each
                  sortable on its raw value; DLQ cell tints amber when >0, web `failures > 0`).
• Formatting    : fmtNumber (locale grouped, settings precision, halfUp, non-finite→0), formatBytes (B/KB/MB/GB 1024-step,
                  toFixed-style '.'), formatRelative (just now / Xm / Xh / Xd / "MMM d, yyyy" fallback / "—") — byte-for-byte
                  web parity (golden-vector EXECUTED, see below).
• States        : loading (skeletons) / empty (TSEmptyState emptyTitle+emptyMessage, plus emptyTable note under 503) /
                  error (VehicleCostErrorState verbatim message + retry) / success (table) — every region, never blank (ADR-011).
• i18n          : 100% via VehicleCostStrings facade against Localizable.xcstrings; zero hardcoded literals (web English
                  fallbacks supplied). 24 parity keys + 4 window-option keys added to the catalog.
• a11y          : VoiceOver — VehicleCostAccessibility.totalSummary / rowSummary; banner/empty/error combined elements;
                  window picker .accessibilityLabel; Dynamic Type via Font.TS roles; light/dark via design tokens; SI units.
• Telemetry     : P1/S11 view.opened emitted once with surface slug "VehicleCostPage" (OSLogVehicleCostTelemetry default).
• Navigation    : AdminRouteRegistration.registry(base:source:) hosts VehicleCostPage at AppRoute.admin via the shell's
                  AppRouteHostRegistry (deep link /admin/vehicle-cost → .admin via AppRouteParser); wired in TeslaSyncApp
                  chained around SettingsRouteRegistration. Source is injectable (composition root binds the live feed).
• Adaptive      : TSDataTable renders a columnar grid on regular width (macOS/iPad) and a card list on compact iPhone
                  width; LazyVGrid totals adapt; one SwiftUI layer (ADR-002/ADR-006).

